rees Celsius (\u00b0C) by subtracting 273.15.<br/><br/>Please note that the encodings listed here for s2s & uerra (which includes encodings for carra/cerra) include entries for Mean 2 metre temperature. The specific encoding for Mean 2 metre temperature can be found in 228004."}, "unit": {"symbol": "K"}, "observedProperty": {"id": "2t", "label": {"en": "2 metre temperature"}}}}}